man with a wealth of experience, who fires shells embedded with reconnaissance units. It is said that two military leaders once even fought to claim a senior mortarman.","abilities":["Capable of extremely long ranged-attacks","Shells deal area damage to target and any allied units in the surrounding 8 tiles, and exposes targets for 5s","When Exposed, allied units cannot use barricades to keep themselves out of enemy's sight, and take more damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":9000,"atk":500,"def":450,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4.5}},"mateos_guard":{"slug":"mateos_guard","name":"Mateo's Guard","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mateo's Guard.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Mateo's guard. Certain Coalition Army leaders have cultivated such individuals, leading them to feel that they are above their peers.","abilities":["Launches a Straight Shot when positioned in a straight line with an allied unit: fires 2 explosives in the target's direction","When unblocked, Physical and Arts damage taken is reduced"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":1300,"def":1200,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"crying_thief":{"slug":"crying_thief","name":"Crying Thief","icon":"/enemies-icons/Crying Thief.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Perro who left his family to seek out a new life... but all that people know is that he is always weeping.","abilities":["Invisible","Attacks Stun the target"],"levelCount":3,"level":2,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":600,"def":250,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.8